00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.200 line:100%
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.200 line:100%
Qiao.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:55.360 line:100%
The real owner of this house
is you, isn't it?

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.720 line:100%
Mr. He, you're confused.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.240 line:100%
This was my former employer's house.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.440 line:100%
I only lived here before.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.560 line:100%
How could I be the owner?

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.440 line:100%
Then who was your former employer?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.080 line:100%
Many people in Yuanlongli know that.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.240 line:100%
I'm asking about the real employer.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.000 line:100%
The son of Yao Baiyuan,

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.400 line:100%
Yao Xincheng.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:46.320 line:100%
You should know
who I'm talking about, right?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.200 line:100%
In 1996,

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.680 line:100%
Yao Xincheng bought this apartment
under the name of Yao Baiyuan.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.120 line:100%
In 2002,

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.120 line:100%
he asked you to sell it.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.080 line:100%
Then in 2003,

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.280 line:100%
you used Yao Xincheng's name

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.800 line:100%
to buy it back again,

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:06.760 line:100%
but it was never transferred.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:08.960 line:100%
Why?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.640 line:100%
Because you didn't want
your own name to appear

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.160 line:100%
on the owner's list.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.440 line:100%
You smashed this place up

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.160 line:100%
and left it vacant for 12 years.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.480 line:100%
You were worried
that if anyone else lived here,

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.120 line:100%
you'd never feel at ease.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.760 line:100%
Am I right?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.560 line:100%
Yes.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.280 line:100%
I'll never be at ease.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.600 line:100%
In this apartment,

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.840 line:100%
Yao Baiyuan abused me.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.360 line:100%
Wu Shanlong peeped at me.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.800 line:100%
I hate this place to my core.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.360 line:100%
I wanted to vent.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.200 line:100%
I wanted to destroy it.

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:46.560 line:100%
-Is that wrong?
-You can hate people,

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.360 line:100%
but you can't kill them.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.280 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.680 line:20%
you are suspected of intentional murder

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.280 line:20%
in accordance with Article 117

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.080 line:20%
of the Criminal Procedure Law
of the People's Republic of China.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.960 line:100%
Please come with us to the police station
for questioning.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.560 line:20%
SUMMONS

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.040 line:100%
Who did I kill?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.920 line:100%
You are suspected
of kidnapping and murdering

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.120 line:100%
Xu Zhihong and Xu Meng.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:33.560 line:100%
DEMOLITION

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:29.760 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.840 line:100%
I didn't expect
you'd be the one questioning me.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.480 line:100%
I thought

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.040 line:100%
you should've recused yourself,

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.600 line:100%
considering how well we know each other.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:49.840 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:51.480 line:100%
listen carefully.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.640 line:100%
<i>In this room,</i>
<i>there is only one relationship</i>

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:55.680 line:100%
<i>between two people sitting face to face.</i>

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.960 line:100%
That is a police officer
and a criminal suspect.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.280 line:100%
And a suspect has only one way
to address an officer.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.080 line:100%
That is Officer.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:04.920 line:100%
Alright.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.560 line:100%
Officer He.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.280 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.800 line:100%
now tell the truth.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.560 line:100%
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.600 line:100%
Officer He,

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.080 line:100%
I've never harmed anyone,

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.560 line:100%
let alone killed anyone.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:25.520 line:100%
I don't know why Mr. He
and you would suspect me.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.880 line:100%
If not for this evidence,

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.440 line:100%
I wouldn't believe

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.440 line:100%
that the Qiao Suqing
sitting in front of me

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.600 line:100%
would be suspected of murder.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.120 line:100%
But evidence is evidence.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.800 line:100%
It doesn't lie,

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.880 line:100%
much less deceive people on purpose
for all these years.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:44.840 line:100%
Officer He,

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.440 line:100%
I don't know what evidence you have,

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.800 line:100%
but there must be some misunderstanding.

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.960 line:100%
Since you say there's a misunderstanding,

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.680 line:100%
then cooperate with us

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:00.920 line:100%
and answer my questions truthfully.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.480 line:100%
Ask away.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.960 line:100%
While you lived
in No. 415 at New York Block,

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.160 line:100%
was your home ever burglarized?

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.320 line:100%
-No.
-Are you sure nothing was stolen?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:19.520 line:100%
I am.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.640 line:100%
Do you know Yao Xincheng?

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.200 line:100%
Yes.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.360 line:100%
On December 29th, 1996,

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.760 line:100%
did Yao Xincheng give you this dress?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.520 line:100%
I don't remember.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.680 line:100%
Did Mr. Yao tell you

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.320 line:100%
he gave me that dress?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.960 line:100%
Answer my question.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.840 line:100%
If Mr. Yao said he gave it,

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.360 line:100%
then I suppose he did.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.560 line:100%
To make up for what his father did to me,

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.280 line:100%
he gave me many clothes.

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:02.920 line:100%
But I never wore a single one.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.560 line:100%
Putting them on

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:10.160 line:100%
would only remind me
of what his father did to me.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.880 line:100%
Why was the dress Yao Xincheng gave you

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.560 line:100%
hanging in Xu Meng's home?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.600 line:100%
That dress was a classic style
from the Bowls.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.080 line:100%
A lot of people bought it back then.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.960 line:100%
How can you prove

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.880 line:100%
the one in Xu Meng's house
was the one he gave me?

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.200 line:100%
Every question I ask is well-founded.

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:33.240 line:100%
You only need to answer truthfully.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.320 line:100%
Why did the dress Yao Xincheng gave you

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.320 line:100%
appear in Xu Meng's house?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.560 line:100%
Officer He,

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.920 line:100%
my house was never robbed.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.920 line:100%
Any clothes Yao Xincheng gave me,

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.080 line:100%
I took them
to the wholesale clothing market

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.040 line:100%
and sold them cheaply
to small shop owners.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.560 line:100%
As for who they resold them to,

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.160 line:100%
I wouldn't know.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.320 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.040 line:100%
on July 2nd, 1997, where were you?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:12.960 line:100%
I don't remember.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.440 line:100%
All I remember

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:18.480 line:100%
is that during that time,
I stayed home every day studying

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.920 line:100%
and preparing for the Adult Gaokao.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:26.440 line:100%
Officer He, you came to my house then.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.640 line:100%
You asked me what the Adult Gaokao was.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.200 line:100%
We promised each other

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.560 line:100%
we'd both become top students.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.800 line:100%
Qiao Suqing, don't dodge the question.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:55.760 line:100%
Sorry.

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:59.760 line:100%
Maybe too much time has passed.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.280 line:100%
I can only remember the good memories.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:08.560 line:100%
Dad, I really like Ms. Qiao.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.400 line:100%
Can you ask Uncle Ran
to bring me here often?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.960 line:100%
From the first time I met you,

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.640 line:100%
I felt like you'd become family.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.720 line:100%
Since you said

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.480 line:100%
you hated remembering
the harm Yao Baiyuan did to you

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.960 line:100%
and you refused to wear
the clothes Yao Xincheng bought you,

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:36.560 line:100%
then why did you stay
in their apartment for so many years

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:37.720 line:100%
after Yao Baiyuan died,

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:40.160 line:100%
even when people called you a mistress?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.960 line:100%
I had no choice.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.880 line:100%
I had nowhere to go.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.680 line:100%
If I hadn't stayed there,
I would've ended up on the streets.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.160 line:100%
More than my dignity,

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.960 line:100%
I needed to survive.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.880 line:100%
Do you recognize this pair of heels?

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.160 line:100%
No.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.640 line:100%
They appear to be a pair of blue heels.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.520 line:100%
<i>But they were covered in blue leather.</i>

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.960 line:100%
They were supposed to be red heels.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.320 line:100%
Now that I've said this much,

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.520 line:100%
you should recognize it.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:39.960 line:100%
Fine.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.280 line:100%
If you don't know the heels,

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.160 line:100%
there's someone you definitely know.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.440 line:100%
<i>My name is Zhu Ziqiang.</i>

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:57.360 line:100%
<i>I used to work</i>
<i>as Mr. Yao Xincheng's driver.</i>

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.440 line:100%
In the summer of 2002,

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.280 line:100%
Qiao Suqing came to me.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.800 line:100%
<i>She gave me a pair</i>
<i>of Double Fish brand red heels</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.040 line:100%
<i>and 2,000 yuan.</i>

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.160 line:100%
She told me to go to a place
called Pingzhao County

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:12.280 line:100%
and find a shoemaker named Mr. Lu.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:17.280 line:100%
She wanted me to have those red heels
covered with blue leather.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.760 line:100%
<i>Qiao Suqing specifically warned me</i>

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.280 line:100%
<i>that when I went to see Mr. Lu,</i>

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.920 line:100%
<i>I had to cover myself up completely.</i>

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.360 line:100%
<i>Wear a hat or sunglasses.</i>

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.240 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.760 line:100%
why did you do that?

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:34.800 line:100%
And why were those altered heels
found in Wu Shanlong's home?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.440 line:100%
You can tell us now

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.800 line:100%
how you killed Xu Meng and her father

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.880 line:100%
and framed Wu Shanlong.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.800 line:100%
I did ask Yao Xincheng's driver

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.720 line:100%
to have the red heels altered.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.720 line:100%
But later, Wu Shanlong stole them.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.520 line:100%
He had a fetish.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.400 line:100%
He stole women's clothes
from the building.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.480 line:100%
I asked you that in my first question.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.560 line:100%
You said nothing
had been stolen from your home.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.000 line:100%
Can't I forget something?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.760 line:100%
Can a pair of heels prove I'm a murderer?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.600 line:100%
I… I don't even know
Xu Meng and her father.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.800 line:100%
I had nothing to do with them.

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.720 line:100%
Why… Why would I kill them?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.680 line:100%
Who is Fang Xiuhong to you?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.040 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.080 line:100%
answer my question.

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.320 line:100%
Who is Fang Xiuhong to you?

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.080 line:100%
She was my mother.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.800 line:100%
She was one of the victims
of the August 24th Mount Wu Accident.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.400 line:100%
Right?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.280 line:100%
XU ZHIHONG, XU MENG

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:04.680 line:100%
FANG XIUHONG, QIAO SUQING

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.480 line:100%
Xu Meng and Xu Zhihong

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:09.560 line:100%
were among the victims
of that accident too.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.280 line:100%
Yet you claimed
you had nothing to do with them?

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.720 line:100%
Xu Meng deserved to die!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.000 line:100%
She deserved it!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.680 line:100%
<i>In August 1995, my mother and I</i>

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.600 line:100%
<i>signed up for a tour group.</i>

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.000 line:100%
Alright, everyone. Let's do a roll call.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.120 line:100%
-Wang Zusheng.
-Here.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.040 line:100%
-Qiao Suqing.
-Here.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.520 line:100%
Fang Xiuhong.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:45.960 line:100%
Here.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.480 line:100%
-Xu Zhihong.
-Over here.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.000 line:100%
-Xu Meng.
-Here.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.600 line:100%
Be careful.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:58.920 line:100%
Stay close together.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.960 line:100%
You can slow down a little.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.400 line:100%
Well. Everyone in the back, keep up.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.600 line:100%
Steady yourselves.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.480 line:100%
Hold on to the rope beside you.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.560 line:100%
Be careful.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:15.640 line:100%
Those taking photos,
once you're done, catch up quickly.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.560 line:100%
Meng, move this way a bit.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.480 line:100%
Closer this way.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.520 line:100%
Yes.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:22.680 line:100%
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.080 line:100%
Your cap.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.320 line:100%
<i>Everyone,</i>

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.360 line:100%
<i>watch your footing.</i>

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.600 line:100%
<i>The trail is slippery.</i>

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.560 line:100%
<i>Be mindful of both sides.</i>

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.320 line:100%
<i>Mount Wu not only has beautiful scenery,</i>

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.600 line:100%
<i>but also over a hundred species of plants.</i>

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.080 line:100%
I tripped.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.280 line:100%
-Are you alright?
-Be careful.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.840 line:100%
Why is the fog so thick?

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.080 line:100%
We can't even see the road.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.800 line:100%
Exactly. My wife fell.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.680 line:100%
<i>Everyone, don't panic.</i>

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.760 line:100%
<i>This kind of weather</i>
<i>is very common on Mount Wu.</i>

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.200 line:100%
<i>The heavy fog will clear soon.</i>

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:10.680 line:100%
<i>How about this?</i>
<i>Hold hands with people around you.</i>

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:12.280 line:100%
<i>Don't get separated.</i>

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.879 line:100%
<i>Follow me. Alright?</i>

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:14.560 line:100%
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.200 line:100%
-Hang in there.
-Take it slow.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.399 line:100%
Walk slowly.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.240 line:100%
Walk slowly.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.000 line:100%
I…

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.400 line:100%
-I can't breathe.
-Come.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.320 line:100%
Rest here for a bit.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.480 line:100%
Sit down.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.280 line:100%
Why are you sitting down?

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.240 line:100%
Hurry up. Don't hold us back.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.320 line:100%
I can't walk anymore.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:47.880 line:100%
You see,

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.440 line:100%
we really can't stay here.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.960 line:100%
It'll be dark soon.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.000 line:100%
We'll freeze to death if we stay here.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.080 line:100%
Can't you be considerate
and wait a little?

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.840 line:100%
You can't drag us down with you.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.600 line:100%
Why bother with them? Let's just go.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.320 line:100%
-Go.
-Let's leave.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:03.440 line:100%
You rest a bit. Catch up quickly.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.000 line:100%
Qing.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.160 line:100%
Qing.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.320 line:100%
Qing.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.480 line:100%
Qing.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:14.600 line:100%
Qing.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:25.720 line:100%
Mom.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:29.640 line:100%
Mom.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.560 line:100%
Mom.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:39.000 line:100%
-Excuse me. Where's my mom?
-Don't… Don't come near us.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.600 line:100%
I'm warning you.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.040 line:100%
Don't…

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:46.360 line:100%
Don't try anything.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.200 line:100%
What are you talking about?

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.320 line:100%
Where… Where's my mom?

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.520 line:100%
You're worse than an animal!

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.280 line:100%
You have no conscience!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.880 line:100%
You… What are you talking about?

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.920 line:100%
I'm just asking where my mom is.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.520 line:100%
Stop pretending.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.480 line:100%
Before you passed out, you went crazy

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.320 line:100%
trying to tear the clothes
off my dad and me.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:06.160 line:100%
We refused,

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.120 line:100%
and you nearly pushed my dad
off the cliff.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.880 line:100%
His leg was broken.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:10.880 line:100%
Then…

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.000 line:100%
Then you went to grab your mom's clothes.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.720 line:100%
Your mom was frozen stiff.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.080 line:100%
She wouldn't give them to you,

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.920 line:100%
and you pushed her off the cliff.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.760 line:100%
No. That can't be true.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.440 line:100%
Mom!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.480 line:100%
Mom!

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:38.840 line:100%
Where are you, Mom?

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.200 line:100%
Mom!

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:41.800 line:100%
Mom!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.440 line:100%
Mom!

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.160 line:100%
I passed out from the cold again

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.280 line:100%
at the bottom of the cliff.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.440 line:100%
<i>When I woke up,</i>

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:07.040 line:100%
<i>I found myself in the rescue vehicle.</i>

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.520 line:100%
They found my mother's body

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.000 line:100%
at the bottom of the cliff.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.000 line:100%
After the incident,

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:38.120 line:100%
my aunt took me in.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.640 line:100%
<i>I ate, lived, and worked</i>

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.280 line:100%
<i>at her restaurant.</i>

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.720 line:100%
We got along well at first.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:53.240 line:100%
But after the compensation money came in,

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:56.760 line:100%
everything changed.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:01.000 line:100%
You jinx! Are you blind?

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.040 line:100%
There, there. Don't cry.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.200 line:100%
You killed my sister,
and that still wasn't enough?

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.360 line:100%
Stay away from my granddaughter.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:07.840 line:100%
Rotten luck.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.080 line:100%
Meeting you was the worst thing
that ever happened to me.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:17.360 line:100%
Qing, are you tired?

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.160 line:100%
Look at you. Your clothes are soaked.

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:22.080 line:100%
I'll help you change.

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:23.200 line:100%
You might catch a cold.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.280 line:100%
Catching a cold is serious.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.640 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.600 line:100%
You shameless flirt.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.240 line:100%
I'll beat you to death. You witch!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.040 line:100%
Shameless flirt! Shameless!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.160 line:100%
Trash!

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:33.040 line:100%
Flirt!

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.880 line:100%
Witch! Witch!

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.840 line:100%
Qing, come here.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:44.040 line:100%
Leave the dishes for now.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.040 line:100%
Come. I have something to tell you.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:47.400 line:100%
Great news.

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.440 line:100%
You've worked hard.

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:52.600 line:100%
I've found you a good place.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.520 line:100%
She said she found me a good place,

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.200 line:100%
but really, she took someone's money

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:05.120 line:100%
and sold me away to be
a servant in another town.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:10.920 line:100%
When I first met Yao Xincheng,

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.000 line:100%
I thought

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:18.600 line:100%
he looked like
a refined and successful man.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:25.600 line:100%
<i>I thought to myself,</i>

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.960 line:100%
<i>my luck wasn't that bad after all.</i>

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.520 line:100%
Serving someone like him

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:35.800 line:100%
had to be a thousand times better
than staying at my aunt's home.

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:39.880 line:20%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:47.440 line:100%
But I was completely wrong.

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.440 line:100%
<i>Yao Xincheng brought me to Yuanlongli</i>

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:57.280 line:100%
<i>to look after his father.</i>

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:21.600 line:100%
<i>From the day I met Yao Baiyuan,</i>

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:23.440 line:100%
<i>I finally understood</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.840 line:100%
<i>what a true living hell was.</i>

00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:41.240 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:42.160 line:100%
Mr. Yao,

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:44.640 line:100%
I really can't do this anymore.

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:47.480 line:100%
I'll find a way to pay back

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:49.760 line:100%
however much you paid my aunt.

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:58.880 line:100%
-Wait outside.
-Alright.

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:06.560 line:100%
Qiao,

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:08.960 line:100%
I apologize on behalf of my dad.

00:24:09.840 --> 00:24:11.040 line:100%
Given his current condition,

00:24:11.120 --> 00:24:12.720 line:100%
I really can't find anyone else.

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.200 line:100%
I can raise your pay.

00:24:14.280 --> 00:24:16.120 line:100%
As much as you want. Is that alright?

00:24:22.040 --> 00:24:23.400 line:100%
I went to Weiyang Mall earlier today

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:24.560 line:100%
and picked out some gifts for you.

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:25.840 line:100%
Here. Take it.

00:24:25.920 --> 00:24:28.840 line:100%
Mr. Yao, I really can't do this anymore.

00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:41.560 line:100%
Five years.

00:24:42.280 --> 00:24:44.240 line:100%
If you can take care of my dad
for five full years,

00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:46.800 line:100%
I'll transfer the apartment to you.

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:48.440 line:100%
Alright?

00:24:49.320 --> 00:24:52.920 line:100%
Don't you want
a home of your own in Weiyang?

00:24:56.160 --> 00:24:57.680 line:100%
<i>A home of my own…</i>

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:00.680 line:100%
<i>That offer was too tempting.</i>

00:25:03.080 --> 00:25:03.920 line:100%
I was moved.

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:07.360 line:100%
So I forced myself

00:25:08.600 --> 00:25:09.680 line:100%
to endure it

00:25:10.360 --> 00:25:11.320 line:100%
and suffer through it.

00:25:12.880 --> 00:25:14.800 line:100%
That's how I lasted a whole year.

00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:19.880 line:100%
Maybe Heaven pitied me.

00:25:20.960 --> 00:25:22.560 line:100%
At the end of 1996,

00:25:23.160 --> 00:25:26.080 line:100%
Yao Baiyuan went up
to the 18th floor at night

00:25:26.160 --> 00:25:28.760 line:100%
to peep at the Pattia staff

00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:32.080 line:100%
and fell to his death.

00:25:33.920 --> 00:25:36.320 line:100%
Qian Dajun knows everything about that.

00:25:37.280 --> 00:25:38.720 line:100%
Yao Xincheng

00:25:39.360 --> 00:25:40.960 line:100%
was a wealthy businessman
from another province.

00:25:41.520 --> 00:25:43.120 line:100%
He was in overseas trade.

00:25:43.720 --> 00:25:46.360 line:100%
His father was Yao Baiyuan.

00:25:46.440 --> 00:25:49.280 line:100%
He had a strange illness.
He couldn't stand daylight.

00:25:49.360 --> 00:25:50.920 line:100%
No one could cure it.

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:52.800 line:100%
In 1995,

00:25:52.880 --> 00:25:54.720 line:100%
he came to Weiyang for business

00:25:54.800 --> 00:25:58.320 line:100%
and heard that the Qihuang Clinic
in our building

00:25:58.400 --> 00:25:59.960 line:100%
specialized in rare illnesses.

00:26:00.040 --> 00:26:01.760 line:100%
To make treatment easier,

00:26:01.840 --> 00:26:03.000 line:100%
Yao Xincheng

00:26:04.040 --> 00:26:06.920 line:100%
bought an apartment at New York Block
under Yao Baiyuan's name.

00:26:07.000 --> 00:26:08.800 line:100%
He hired a maid.

00:26:09.560 --> 00:26:10.640 line:100%
You don't know this,

00:26:10.720 --> 00:26:12.640 line:100%
but Yao Baiyuan was a pervert.

00:26:13.360 --> 00:26:16.800 line:100%
He had ways and means
to torment those young maids.

00:26:16.880 --> 00:26:17.680 line:100%
Be serious.

00:26:19.160 --> 00:26:20.080 line:100%
Alright.

00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:23.560 line:100%
Well, no maid could put up with it.

00:26:23.640 --> 00:26:24.680 line:100%
None of them lasted long.

00:26:24.760 --> 00:26:26.560 line:100%
He was changing maids every week or two.

00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:27.960 line:100%
In the end,

00:26:28.040 --> 00:26:30.960 line:100%
every maid in Weiyang
refused to work for him.

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:33.760 line:100%
<i>Yao Xincheng could only</i>

00:26:33.840 --> 00:26:36.480 line:100%
<i>pay high prices to hire</i>
<i>a maid from another town.</i>

00:26:37.720 --> 00:26:41.120 line:100%
How did Yao Baiyuan die?

00:26:42.320 --> 00:26:44.760 line:100%
That pervert got himself killed.

00:26:45.360 --> 00:26:46.920 line:100%
He ran to the 18th floor to Pattia

00:26:47.000 --> 00:26:48.760 line:100%
to peep at the girls changing.

00:27:29.480 --> 00:27:30.800 line:100%
Help! Help!

00:27:50.880 --> 00:27:53.760 line:100%
Does Yao Baiyuan's death
have anything to do with Qiao Suqing?

00:27:54.760 --> 00:27:55.920 line:100%
Probably not.

00:27:56.960 --> 00:27:58.720 line:100%
The police came too.

00:27:58.800 --> 00:28:00.040 line:100%
His death was ruled accidental.

00:28:00.120 --> 00:28:01.960 line:100%
Besides, whenever he went out,

00:28:02.040 --> 00:28:03.560 line:100%
he always locked Qiao Suqing inside.

00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:05.840 line:100%
After that accident,

00:28:05.920 --> 00:28:08.000 line:100%
Yao Xincheng returned from overseas.

00:28:08.080 --> 00:28:10.680 line:100%
It wasn't until after he dealt
with the funeral arrangements

00:28:10.760 --> 00:28:13.680 line:100%
that he remembered
someone was still locked inside No. 415.

00:28:20.960 --> 00:28:22.000 line:100%
Give me a hand.

00:28:45.280 --> 00:28:47.120 line:100%
Mr. Yao was a filial son.

00:28:47.640 --> 00:28:49.360 line:100%
He wanted to earn virtue for his father.

00:28:50.080 --> 00:28:53.480 line:100%
So he kept his promise
and transferred that apartment to me.

00:28:54.200 --> 00:28:56.880 line:100%
It was just that
he held foreign citizenship,

00:28:57.480 --> 00:28:59.520 line:100%
and the inheritance procedures
were complicated.

00:28:59.600 --> 00:29:02.000 line:100%
So he let me live there first

00:29:02.520 --> 00:29:06.160 line:100%
and said he'd handle the paperwork
the next time he came back.

00:29:07.280 --> 00:29:09.080 line:100%
I lived there for five years.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:12.360 line:100%
By

00:29:14.160 --> 00:29:15.560 line:100%
the winter of 2002,

00:29:15.640 --> 00:29:17.680 line:100%
he still didn't have time to come back.

00:29:18.200 --> 00:29:19.760 line:100%
I started pressing him about it.

00:29:21.040 --> 00:29:22.960 line:100%
So he mailed me all the documents

00:29:23.040 --> 00:29:24.040 line:100%
and told me to handle it for him.

00:29:24.120 --> 00:29:27.720 line:100%
But by then, I wanted
to leave that apartment.

00:29:28.920 --> 00:29:30.320 line:100%
So I sold it.

00:29:31.040 --> 00:29:34.080 line:100%
Why did you buy it back in early 2003?

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:37.360 line:100%
At the time, I was working
at an insurance company.

00:29:38.440 --> 00:29:40.920 line:100%
I dealt with a lot
of real estate developers.

00:29:42.600 --> 00:29:45.920 line:100%
They all said housing prices
in Weiyang were about to skyrocket.

00:29:46.960 --> 00:29:49.040 line:100%
Even though Yuanlongli
had rumors about a cursed building,

00:29:49.640 --> 00:29:51.200 line:100%
and prices there wouldn't rise much,

00:29:51.720 --> 00:29:52.880 line:100%
the location was still excellent.

00:29:52.960 --> 00:29:54.800 line:100%
If it couldn't be sold,

00:29:55.320 --> 00:29:56.760 line:100%
the owners could always wait
for demolition compensation.

00:29:57.800 --> 00:29:58.960 line:100%
Later, I worked hard

00:29:59.040 --> 00:30:00.840 line:100%
to get into the demolition department
of a property company

00:30:01.480 --> 00:30:03.880 line:100%
so I could get
a bigger share of the payout.

00:30:05.400 --> 00:30:07.360 line:100%
Why did you buy it
under Yao Xincheng's name

00:30:07.960 --> 00:30:09.440 line:100%
and leave it untransferred
for more than ten years?

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:13.120 line:100%
Back then, there were always rumors
in the building

00:30:14.320 --> 00:30:16.120 line:100%
that I was being kept by some rich man.

00:30:16.800 --> 00:30:18.280 line:100%
I had no way to explain it.

00:30:18.800 --> 00:30:20.760 line:100%
If the apartment showed under my name,

00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:24.040 line:100%
there'd be even less way to explain it.

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:26.600 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:30:27.720 --> 00:30:29.360 line:100%
your story is touching.

00:30:30.920 --> 00:30:33.720 line:100%
But it has nothing to do with my question.

00:30:35.600 --> 00:30:37.480 line:100%
I'll repeat myself.

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:48.000 line:100%
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

00:30:50.120 --> 00:30:51.120 line:100%
Officer He,

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:53.080 line:100%
I already told you.

00:30:53.160 --> 00:30:54.840 line:100%
Their deaths had nothing to do with me.

00:30:54.920 --> 00:30:56.640 line:100%
Did you see them again

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:58.680 line:100%
after the Mount Wu accident?

00:31:03.600 --> 00:31:04.440 line:100%
Yes.

00:31:06.240 --> 00:31:07.760 line:100%
I saw Xu Meng.

00:31:11.680 --> 00:31:12.520 line:100%
Scissors.

00:31:12.600 --> 00:31:13.520 line:100%
-Drink.
-Come on.

00:31:13.600 --> 00:31:15.000 line:100%
What are you waiting for? Drink.

00:31:16.320 --> 00:31:17.480 line:100%
-Again.
-One more!

00:31:17.560 --> 00:31:20.040 line:100%
-Rock, paper, scissors.
-Rock, paper, scissors.

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:21.400 line:100%
Drink.

00:31:29.920 --> 00:31:33.800 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:31:35.920 --> 00:31:37.320 line:100%
Pretending not to know me?

00:31:43.960 --> 00:31:45.680 line:100%
We're pretty fated

00:31:45.760 --> 00:31:47.640 line:100%
to run into each other in Weiyang.

00:31:48.600 --> 00:31:50.360 line:100%
I came here to visit a friend.

00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:51.640 line:100%
I'm leaving tomorrow.

00:31:53.000 --> 00:31:54.120 line:100%
Lend me some money.

00:31:56.640 --> 00:31:57.640 line:100%
I have no money.

00:31:57.720 --> 00:31:58.880 line:100%
No money?

00:32:06.440 --> 00:32:08.760 line:100%
Did you forget who you are,

00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:11.040 line:100%
murderer?

00:32:12.120 --> 00:32:14.800 line:100%
You pushed your mom off the cliff.

00:32:16.360 --> 00:32:17.760 line:100%
Do the police know that?

00:32:23.960 --> 00:32:25.000 line:100%
Wait.

00:32:29.800 --> 00:32:31.800 line:100%
You're not staying
at a friend's place, are you?

00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:27.400 line:100%
Nice?

00:33:29.200 --> 00:33:30.040 line:100%
This…

00:33:31.040 --> 00:33:32.400 line:100%
This was a gift. You can't take it.

00:33:48.000 --> 00:33:48.840 line:100%
Thanks.

00:34:01.840 --> 00:34:04.080 line:100%
<i>I had just crawled out of one living hell,</i>

00:34:06.000 --> 00:34:07.959 line:100%
<i>only to be dragged into another.</i>

00:34:11.439 --> 00:34:12.479 line:100%
Xu Meng

00:34:13.240 --> 00:34:15.519 line:100%
worked at Pattia on the 18th floor.

00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:19.680 line:100%
She kept knocking on my door,
asking for money.

00:34:19.760 --> 00:34:21.400 line:100%
In the spring of 1997,

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:24.760 line:100%
there was a crackdown
on prostitution at Pattia.

00:34:25.519 --> 00:34:27.560 line:100%
I thought I had finally broken free.

00:34:29.280 --> 00:34:30.800 line:100%
But instead, she came even more often,

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:33.760 line:100%
saying she owed loan sharks.

00:34:34.560 --> 00:34:36.400 line:100%
I had no money to give her,

00:34:36.999 --> 00:34:40.080 line:100%
so she started taking things from my home.

00:34:40.160 --> 00:34:41.400 line:100%
Until…

00:34:42.479 --> 00:34:44.400 line:100%
Until I met someone.

00:34:46.200 --> 00:34:47.479 line:100%
To be precise,

00:34:51.439 --> 00:34:53.080 line:100%
he wasn't even human.

00:34:59.240 --> 00:35:00.360 line:100%
Hold on.

00:35:04.760 --> 00:35:05.920 line:100%
Thank you.

00:35:20.640 --> 00:35:21.480 line:100%
Miss,

00:35:22.320 --> 00:35:24.480 line:100%
sell your stockings to me.

00:35:25.640 --> 00:35:27.240 line:100%
Name any price you want.

00:35:30.880 --> 00:35:32.000 line:100%
I can help you take them off.

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:35.440 line:100%
Don't come near me.

00:35:38.240 --> 00:35:40.600 line:100%
-Come on.
-Don't come near me!

00:35:44.480 --> 00:35:46.280 line:100%
Later, I found out

00:35:46.960 --> 00:35:48.160 line:100%
Wu Shanlong

00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:51.600 line:100%
was the brother-in-law
of a rich businessman, Song Qingsong.

00:35:52.200 --> 00:35:53.560 line:100%
He lived on the 17th floor.

00:35:54.080 --> 00:35:55.200 line:100%
From then on,

00:35:55.720 --> 00:35:57.080 line:100%
I hid whenever I saw him.

00:35:57.960 --> 00:35:59.720 line:100%
But what was bound to happen

00:36:00.440 --> 00:36:02.360 line:100%
was impossible to escape.

00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:08.240 line:100%
I heard someone

00:36:10.080 --> 00:36:11.640 line:100%
has been following you lately, right?

00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:16.040 line:100%
A girl from the foot massage shop.

00:36:16.560 --> 00:36:17.760 line:100%
Her name is Mengmeng.

00:36:18.880 --> 00:36:20.280 line:100%
I can help you take care of it.

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:23.640 line:100%
You only need to give me

00:36:23.720 --> 00:36:25.720 line:100%
a little reward.

00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:33.600 line:100%
Miss.

00:36:34.480 --> 00:36:36.920 line:100%
Miss, once you've thought it through,

00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:39.600 line:100%
come to me anytime.

00:36:41.720 --> 00:36:44.120 line:100%
<i>I knew what kind of man Wu Shanlong was.</i>

00:36:45.600 --> 00:36:47.200 line:100%
I didn't want to be
involved with him in any way.

00:36:48.680 --> 00:36:51.400 line:100%
So I did nothing but stay hidden at home.

00:36:52.080 --> 00:36:53.680 line:100%
A few days later,

00:36:53.760 --> 00:36:55.440 line:100%
<i>I heard</i>

00:36:55.520 --> 00:36:58.680 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng and her father</i>
<i>had disappeared in the building.</i>

00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:09.320 line:100%
<i>Eighteen pillars</i>

00:37:09.400 --> 00:37:10.520 line:100%
<i>with 18 men to carry them.</i>

00:37:10.600 --> 00:37:11.840 line:100%
<i>Eighteen bodies,</i>

00:37:11.920 --> 00:37:13.040 line:100%
<i>18 heads.</i>

00:37:13.120 --> 00:37:14.800 line:100%
<i>Pass this rhyme on to three people.</i>

00:37:14.880 --> 00:37:17.640 line:100%
<i>Otherwise, calamity will befall you</i>
<i>within three days.</i>

00:37:27.400 --> 00:37:28.360 line:100%
What are you doing? Get out!

00:37:33.560 --> 00:37:34.320 line:100%
Miss,

00:37:35.320 --> 00:37:36.720 line:100%
Mengmeng and her dad

00:37:37.400 --> 00:37:38.320 line:100%
are dead.

00:37:40.200 --> 00:37:41.280 line:100%
I killed them.

00:37:43.600 --> 00:37:44.800 line:100%
I lured them into my place

00:37:45.880 --> 00:37:46.760 line:100%
and killed them both with one stab each.

00:37:52.360 --> 00:37:54.720 line:100%
I've already taken care of your problem.

00:37:55.240 --> 00:37:56.440 line:100%
Shouldn't you

00:37:57.240 --> 00:37:58.960 line:100%
pay me back now?

00:38:03.280 --> 00:38:04.560 line:100%
Whatever you did
has nothing to do with me.

00:38:04.640 --> 00:38:06.920 line:100%
Get out of here,
or I'm calling the police.

00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:08.360 line:100%
Go ahead.

00:38:08.960 --> 00:38:10.240 line:100%
Call the police.

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:13.040 line:100%
About what Mengmeng told me
before she died,

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:16.080 line:100%
I'd like to speak with the police.

00:38:20.720 --> 00:38:21.560 line:100%
Miss,

00:38:23.000 --> 00:38:25.520 line:100%
what you did on Mount Wu,

00:38:26.520 --> 00:38:27.960 line:100%
I know all about it.

00:39:07.360 --> 00:39:08.280 line:100%
Come on.

00:39:09.680 --> 00:39:10.840 line:100%
Give me a smile.

00:39:20.360 --> 00:39:21.760 line:100%
From then on,

00:39:24.480 --> 00:39:26.600 line:100%
Wu Shanlong kept coming,

00:39:28.560 --> 00:39:31.240 line:100%
asking for

00:39:31.920 --> 00:39:32.760 line:100%
worn underwear

00:39:33.400 --> 00:39:34.360 line:100%
and stockings.

00:39:39.480 --> 00:39:40.960 line:100%
It disgusted me,

00:39:41.040 --> 00:39:42.640 line:100%
but I was too scared to fight back.

00:39:43.240 --> 00:39:45.200 line:100%
I put up with it for four or five years.

00:39:45.280 --> 00:39:46.640 line:100%
I never thought

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:49.080 line:100%
he would go even further.

00:39:55.040 --> 00:39:56.080 line:100%
Miss,

00:39:56.600 --> 00:39:58.360 line:100%
whatever you do at home,

00:39:58.440 --> 00:40:00.360 line:100%
act natural like before.

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:02.160 line:100%
Don't avoid the camera

00:40:03.000 --> 00:40:05.280 line:100%
or close the curtains.

00:40:05.360 --> 00:40:07.480 line:100%
Not even when you sleep.

00:40:17.760 --> 00:40:18.720 line:100%
Cheer up, miss.

00:40:22.680 --> 00:40:24.880 line:100%
<i>All I wanted was to crawl</i>
<i>out of the abyss,</i>

00:40:25.400 --> 00:40:27.000 line:100%
<i>to see the light,</i>

00:40:27.880 --> 00:40:29.240 line:100%
<i>and hold onto it.</i>

00:40:34.160 --> 00:40:36.840 line:100%
<i>Someone always dragged me back down.</i>

00:40:41.320 --> 00:40:42.560 line:100%
During that time,

00:40:45.600 --> 00:40:48.400 line:100%
I thought about killing myself
more than once.

00:40:50.320 --> 00:40:51.520 line:100%
Later,

00:40:51.600 --> 00:40:53.080 line:100%
Xu Zhihong's severed head

00:40:53.160 --> 00:40:55.320 line:100%
was found on the rooftop.

00:40:57.200 --> 00:40:58.200 line:100%
That's when I found out

00:41:01.360 --> 00:41:03.840 line:100%
Wu Shanlong hadn't just killed
Xu Meng and her father,

00:41:05.600 --> 00:41:07.640 line:100%
he had dismembered them too.

00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:11.880 line:100%
I was so terrified,
I couldn't sleep for days.

00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:13.920 line:100%
I was scared that one day,

00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:15.840 line:100%
I would end up just like them.

00:41:16.640 --> 00:41:17.920 line:100%
So I thought

00:41:18.520 --> 00:41:21.280 line:100%
I had to break free
from Wu Shanlong's control.

00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:24.080 line:100%
I had to make that murderer pay
for what he did.

00:41:25.400 --> 00:41:27.440 line:100%
Wu Shanlong had a fetish.

00:41:27.520 --> 00:41:29.960 line:100%
He stole clothes
from women in the building.

00:41:30.840 --> 00:41:32.440 line:100%
So I went to a secondhand shop

00:41:33.040 --> 00:41:37.560 line:100%
and found a pair of heels
the same style Xu Meng took from me.

00:41:37.640 --> 00:41:39.880 line:100%
But they only had red.

00:41:40.840 --> 00:41:42.840 line:100%
I had no friends in Weiyang,

00:41:43.680 --> 00:41:45.440 line:100%
so I paid

00:41:45.520 --> 00:41:47.520 line:100%
Yao Xincheng's driver

00:41:48.160 --> 00:41:49.800 line:100%
to have them changed to blue.

00:42:13.200 --> 00:42:14.160 line:100%
Those shoes,

00:42:15.040 --> 00:42:16.200 line:100%
I want them too.

00:42:21.840 --> 00:42:23.360 line:100%
I'm not taking them off in the hallway.

00:42:52.440 --> 00:42:55.600 line:100%
Miss, you're a curious cat.

00:42:58.840 --> 00:43:00.200 line:100%
I have something

00:43:00.800 --> 00:43:02.360 line:100%
more wild.

00:43:05.600 --> 00:43:06.560 line:100%
Want to see?

00:43:21.200 --> 00:43:22.040 line:100%
Come on.

00:43:24.320 --> 00:43:25.320 line:100%
Come on.

00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:39.160 line:100%
I believe you know

00:44:41.400 --> 00:44:42.640 line:100%
what happened after that.

00:44:43.960 --> 00:44:45.960 line:100%
That's the whole truth.

00:44:46.920 --> 00:44:48.760 line:100%
I did hate Xu Meng,

00:44:49.920 --> 00:44:51.840 line:100%
but I didn't kill her or her father.

00:44:52.480 --> 00:44:53.320 line:100%
Instead,

00:44:56.880 --> 00:44:58.200 line:100%
I was a victim too.

00:45:00.960 --> 00:45:02.160 line:100%
Your story is flawless.

00:45:06.720 --> 00:45:08.120 line:100%
This whole explanation,

00:45:08.200 --> 00:45:10.320 line:100%
you must've planned for years, didn't you?